# Meteor publishes every file it finds in a package folder, including a
# top-level node_modules. The release steps run npm install here, so without
# this list the dev tooling (semantic-release, npm, playwright, ...) ships to
# every app; 2.0.0 carried 226 MB of it. Runtime npm packages come from
# Npm.depends via .npm/package, which this file does not affect.
#
# Only lib/ and tests/ are visible. tests/ stays because the test entry point
# requires its sibling test files. A new top-level folder the package loads
# must be added here.
/*
!/lib/
!/tests/
